@startuml
title Re-entrancy deadlock: both sides wait for the other

participant "PC" as PC
participant "MCU" as MCU

PC -> MCU : request start_calibration
activate PC
activate MCU
PC -> PC : waits for the response
MCU -> PC : request confirm_user_present
note right of PC
  Nobody reads this: the PC thread
  is blocked on the first response.
end note
MCU -> MCU : waits for the response
deactivate MCU
deactivate PC

note over PC, MCU #FFDDDD
  Both ends are blocked. A handler must never
  wait on a call it issued itself.
end note
@enduml
